    "en": {
      "name": "Ars Magna - \"Philosophirum\"",
      "effect": "Target up to 3 \"Ars Magna\" monsters in your field and/or GY; banish them, then you can negate the effects of up to that many other face-up cards on the field until the end of this turn. You can banish this card from your GY; return 1 \"Power Patron\" Link Monster from your GY into the Extra Deck, then you can Special Summon it. You can only use 1 \"Ars Magna - \"Philosophirum\"\" effect per turn, and only once that turn.",
      "official": false
    },
